flowchart TB
  seed[seed] --> plan[plan<br/>writes, batches, uploads, subscribers with cursors, restarts]
  plan --> run[pds-sim run, one thread<br/>clock, revision clock and random source from the seed]
  run --> vfs[power loss below SQLite<br/>writes since the last sync are lost or torn]
  vfs --> sut
  run --> fp[fail points<br/>before the commit is stored, after it, after its event]
  seed --> netplan[network plan<br/>writes over HTTP, partitions and held messages on the relay's link]
  netplan --> net[pds-sim --network<br/>server, strict relay and client as hosts on turmoil]
  net --> sut
  net --> o6{the relay received every event once, in order, dropped none, and holds the server's repositories}
  run --> later[not written yet<br/>I/O errors the process survives, a server restart on the network]
  fp --> sut[the router of linkjar-pds, in process<br/>same code as production]
  sut --> restart[stop, start again, repair]
  restart --> o1{verify finds no difference}
  restart --> o2{each repository holds the acknowledged writes and no other}
  restart --> o3{each subscriber saw every event once, in order}
  restart --> o4{a strict relay model converges, with #sync as its only repair}
  restart --> o5{a blob is served only while a record references it}
  run --> meta{two runs of a seed give the same trace}
